msgid ""
"Products from the B2B feed without a OneCatalog public_id. Select the ones "
"to import; the rest stay here. Ignored ones are not offered again."
msgstr ""
"Товары B2B-фида без public_id OneCatalog. Отметьте нужные для импорта; "
